<title>UK: Racal unit wins 3.0 mln stg contract.</title>
<headline>Racal unit wins 3.0 mln stg contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Racal Electronics Plc said on Tuesday its Racal-BRT unit won a contract worth over 3.0 million stg to support Red Star Parcels Ltd's delivery operations.</p>
<p>Racal said the seven-year outsourcing contract involved connection 250 parcel collection and despatch points across Britain.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
